- Sial!
- Kakaknya tenggelam.

00:03:05.120 --> 00:03:06.540
Hei, kamu baik-baik saja?

00:03:09.520 --> 00:03:10.620
Mac!

00:03:11.560 --> 00:03:12.660
Turun dari aku!

00:03:12.800 --> 00:03:13.900
Mac!

00:03:14.320 --> 00:03:15.599
- Turun dari aku!
- Sialan, Mac! Cukup!

00:03:15.600 --> 00:03:16.700
Turun dari aku!

00:03:17.480 --> 00:03:18.580
Hei! Berhenti!

00:03:22.600 --> 00:03:23.679
Mac!

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:24.780
Oh, Mac...

