00:10:33.260 --> 00:10:34.379
Mari kita ucapkan "Sadhu" bersama.

00:10:34.380 --> 00:10:35.760
Mari kita ikat benang doa ini padanya.

00:10:35.860 --> 00:10:37.880
Sadhu.

